n><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>∂</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>∂</mi><mrow><mi>∂</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>∂</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>∂</mi><mrow><mi>∂</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Thus, the Jacobian matrix is\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"329\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D43D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"4\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-s3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B TEX-S3\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 9.857em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"padding-right: 0.5em; padding-bottom: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c 